# Testscript Generator Rules

**Source of truth:** **`AGENTS.md` → Repo contract** (architecture, layers,
locators, waits, assertions, markers, stability).

Skills under `.cursor/skills/` are **task workflows only** — they must not
redefine those rules. Before authoring or reviewing tests, read `AGENTS.md`;
then open the skill for the specific action (`automate-a-flow`,
`testscript-generator`, `discover-mobile-locators`, etc.).

## Always enforce (summary — details in AGENTS.md)

- Import direction: `tests → steps → page_actions → page_objects → core`
- Locators only in `*_po.py` under `# --- Locators ---`
- No `driver.find_element` outside page objects; no POs in tests/steps
- No `time.sleep()` — explicit waits only; re-query after navigation
- Every UI test: `@pytest.mark.e2e` + priority + Allure labels
- No secrets in dataproviders; sync WebDriver only
- Locators confirmed live — never invent from product source alone
